   * iOS scroll event timing nuances:
   * ===============================
   *
   *
   * Scrolling without bouncing, if you touch down:
   * -------------------------------
   *
   * 1. `onMomentumScrollBegin` (when animation begins after letting up)
   *    ... physical touch starts ...
